276
00:16:13,780 --> 00:16:14,820
Such power.

277
00:16:15,220 --> 00:16:17,632
I've never felt such tremendous strength.

278
00:16:18,060 --> 00:16:18,890
Never.

279
00:16:22,700 --> 00:16:23,580
Well, my.

280
