the Blackluster Ritual
works by sacrificing

284
00:16:41,620 --> 00:16:44,385
all of the monsters I
have placed on the field.

285
00:16:49,900 --> 00:16:52,957
Combining the energies of my two separate

286
00:16:53,040 --> 00:16:55,597
monsters And

287
00:16:55,680 --> 00:17:00,057
the forces

288
