the arena again, kiddo.

336
00:19:30,580 --> 00:19:33,220
And when we do, you better watch out.

337
00:19:34,320 --> 00:19:35,150
Mm-hmm.

338
00:19:36,320 --> 00:19:37,150
Hm.
